{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/101154-falling-by-supernatural-means","id":101154,"title":"Falling by supernatural means","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-29T02:04:25-07:00","id":101154,"title":"Falling by supernatural means","content":"I'm wondering if there's supernatural ways that Angels of the God Machine can Fall. In the True Fae thread in this forum, I stated that the Thorns of the Hedge may cause them to Fall by the place's very nature. The reason why, is that since we assume that the God Machine is technically digital by now, and a being of immaculate Order, it would seem that an Angel going into the Hedge has a risk similar as an investigator reading the Necronomicon in Call of Cthulhu.<br /> <br /> So what supernatural ways can Angels Fall into Demonhood unexpectedly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T04:14:07-07:00","id":101181,"title":"","content":"I think there would be a lot more Fallen if Angels were more well known to the supernatural community. I think greater amounts of using supernatural effects against them has that chance. Such as emotion bombing them with mind magic, or binding them to your perception as you live your life. They seem vulnerable to Falling from a number of things, the thing is they aren't guaranteed to fall, its just exposing angels to these things more often probably will result in more fallen in general.<br /> <br /> \u200bBut most don't know about angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T04:23:01-07:00","id":101186,"title":"","content":"I'd have to dig up the exact quote and source, but I believe it's been said that almost nothing supernatural can force an Angel to Fall. And that doing so would be on par with level 8 Imperial Magic, as it's considered changing a template (on par with changing the fundamental nature of a vampire).<br /> <br /> I could be wrong, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T04:36:50-07:00","id":101190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythicFox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/101154-falling-by-supernatural-means?p=101186#post101186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd have to dig up the exact quote and source, but I believe it's been said that almost nothing supernatural can force an Angel to Fall. And that doing so would be on par with level 8 Imperial Magic, as it's considered changing a template (on par with changing the fundamental nature of a vampire).<br /> <br /> I could be wrong, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>No I remember that. I was thinking that just meant you couldn't force them to fall using a Fall spell. I'm pretty sure your free to use supernatural powers in hope it opens their Perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T04:55:29-07:00","id":101197,"title":"","content":"I remember Rose saying something to the same effect as Mythic Fox. Though, if memory serves, the context was a vampire using Dominate to force an angel to disconnect. Its basically a safeguard to prevent one splat from messing around with others before tier 4 level stuff. Its just the same thing as preventing a mage from being able to exorcise a geist from the Sin-Eaters so that return to being a mundane human. There's general rules in place to prevent templates abusing different templates like that.<br /> <br /> Though, using supernatural powers to encourage them to fall, like Majesty to seduce an angel so it would rather enjoy the flesh than serve, I think that's more than good.<br /> <br /> As for angels being torn apart by thorns, I find that a bit difficult, as the God Machine Chronicle book talks about the possibility of Gears in the Hedge. I mean, I doubt the God Machine would send in something so vulnerable into the Hedge when he could just build some kind of protection into the angels before sending them. It always knows the best tools for the job.<br /> <br /> As always, though, individual plot trumps such general rules. If you've got a cool story for it, then run with it! I remember an instance where a Fate mage was undergoing a long plot to undo a major Fae Contract, and the writers thought it was a pretty cool idea - no one jumped on the &quot;You can't do that!&quot; wagon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 03-29-2014, 07:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T05:07:11-07:00","id":101203,"title":"","content":"On the note of Angels in the Hedge.... One thing I feel compelled to point out is that prolonged exposure to Other Realms tend to mess with ephemeral entities. A ghost in the Hisil evolves into a death spirit. A spirit in the hedge tends to turn into a hob. An intruder in the Astral tends to eventually transform into a thought form. <br /> <br /> So, there's a good chance that Angels, while I don't think they'd Fall from being in the hedge... I do think that there's a good chance they'll warp into one of the fae!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T09:05:15-07:00","id":101305,"title":"","content":"Interesting point. I do agree that they wouldn't Fall by being offensively attacked by the other's weapon arsenol, but there's another aspect that might. In Blood and Smoke, I read that the Strix could possess Demons by using the Possess Living ability. The results in most possessions by Strix usually cause a physical and psychological change in the host. If they can possess Demons, why not Angels? The changes that can happen, if done long enough, could corrupt the Angel into Falling. Just saying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T10:17:34-07:00","id":101348,"title":"","content":"Because Angels aren't living? They're ephemeral beings. Demons are physical, living creatures. I don't think strix can possess a spirit of any ilk.<br /> <br /> Could be wrong, but... hey. Possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T12:04:02-07:00","id":101407,"title":"","content":"I would imagine any Angel that actually is intended to deal with Supers or go strange places is built specifically to be resistant/immune to them to avoid risks like the Angel falling due to over exposure to mind fuckery.<br /> <br /> Obviously unintentional exposure would have higher risks as the protection aren't there, but I would think that the God Machine is in tune enough with the Supernaturals of the world to plan for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T12:17:16-07:00","id":101415,"title":"","content":"Angels can only fall by their own free will. Tampering is something the God-Machine's designs account for, while self-determination exists in its blind spot. The most you could do with mind control would be to create something like an Exile, and even then, the state probably wouldn't last that long.<br /> <br /> Now, of course, what &quot;free will&quot; is in the World of Darkness is a question that many of the games ask in different ways, so you could certainly shift where you draw that line in your own campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}